silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_04_initial_algebra_concrete_anchor__publishtreetype a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "PublishTreeType: the type of all finite publish-operation trees; the initial Sigma-algebra carrier for the encyclopedia free monad; every encyclopedia entry (including VetRecord_77_tree for paper-00 and FelisCatusTSN183798_tree for the taxonomy leg) is an element of PublishTreeType" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_04_initial_algebra_concrete_anchor__insigma_isomorphismmap a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "InSigma_IsomorphismMap: the structure map in_Sigma: Sigma(PublishTreeType) -> PublishTreeType; an isomorphism by Lambek's lemma; maps four tagged copies of the tree type back to the tree type by the tree constructors ingest_node, type_node, validate_node, render_node" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_04_initial_algebra_concrete_anchor__catamorphism_vetrecord_colimit a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "CataMorphism_VetRecord_Colimit: the catamorphism fold from PublishTreeType to MittensColimitApex; determined by the colimit structure map alpha: Sigma(MittensColimitApex) -> MittensColimitApex; maps VetRecord_77_tree to the record leg arrow VetRecord_77 -> MittensColimitApex" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_04_initial_algebra_concrete_anchor__vetrecord_77_tree a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "VetRecord_77_tree: the element of PublishTreeType (mu Sigma) representing the publish pipeline for VetRecord_77: the tree with root node render_node, child validate_node, grandchild type_node, and leaf ingest_node applied to TartuClinicIntakeForm; a concrete four-depth tree in the initial algebra" .
